      "writtenOn": "2015-11-02T19:42:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chip has 4 levels: highest, high, medium and locked\nValues are: 55, 3c, 33, and 00\n\nHighest is boot_rom and maybe early boot_loader,\nhigh is boot_loader and maybe early app,\nmedium is app envisioned normal operating level\n\nIn normal deployment, app would never deal with this and instead get handed medium access.",
      "parentUuid": "f6195673_3f4c4253",
